fter or trend\", \"ev\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Compared with the 2018–19 season, increases in influenza vaccination coverage were observed during the 2019–20 season\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Data were weighted to reflect the age, race/ethnicity, and geographic distribution of the total U.S. population of pregnant women\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"Because the opt-in Internet panel sample is not probability-based, no statistical tests were performed.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"A difference was noted as an increase or decrease when a percentage-point difference of ≥5 was found between any values being compared.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS-callable SUDAAN software (version 11.0.1; RTI International) was used to conduct all analyses.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\"]}", "type": "text"}]}